/*_BACKUP
*.bak
/*_PLAN.md
/*_SUMMARY.md
/*_CHECKLIST.md
/temp/

# Stale phase/milestone documentation that was at repo root and consolidated
# into docs/DEVELOPMENT-PLAN.md. All root-only — leading `/` so future docs
# at any nested depth (e.g. src/lib/foo/CHECKLIST.md) aren't silently hidden.
